Unit tests for src/gap_detection.py, written with pytest.

test_gap_detection.py has 21 tests in two groups:
  TestBlackBox  written from the requirements only (given these inputs,
                expect this output)
  TestWhiteBox  written from the code's branches and paths

Every test name starts with its test case ID (S = scoring, I = ingestion,
Q = queue, L = call log, E = end to end, W = white-box). The tests use an
in-memory database and a fixed as-of time, so no result depends on the clock.
